iio: adc: ad7173: drop the unused sigma_delta_info copy from the state

Stable commit 24b89b747b1c0 ("iio: adc: ad7173: fix using shared static info struct") gives
each device its own copy of the struct ad_sigma_delta_info in struct
ad7173_state. Downstream main already has the newer upstream layout with one
const struct ad_sigma_delta_info per slot count, selected through
ad7173_device_info.sd_info, so the conflicting probe hunks were resolved to the
downstream code and the new state member is never used. Remove it.

diff --git a/drivers/iio/adc/ad7173.c b/drivers/iio/adc/ad7173.c
--- a/drivers/iio/adc/ad7173.c
+++ b/drivers/iio/adc/ad7173.c
@@ -237,7 +237,6 @@
 
 struct ad7173_state {
 	struct ad_sigma_delta sd;
-	struct ad_sigma_delta_info sigma_delta_info;
 	const struct ad7173_device_info *info;
 	struct ad7173_channel *channels;
 	struct regulator_bulk_data regulators[3];
